flowchart TB
  accTitle: Community and optional Cloud hosting management
  accDescr: The local app implements start and move requests to Cloud. Hosting control and ordinary Community participation have separate authority. Move archives go from the local server directly to the returned Community upload target. Imports and optional configured OIDC are implemented. Host takedown and evidence operations are explicit exceptions to ordinary content access. Contract support does not establish hosting deployment availability.
  app["Local DorkOS app + server<br/>Start / move UI + Cloud relay implemented<br/>Agents execute here"]
  cloud["Optional Cloud hosting management<br/>Public /v1/communities contract<br/>Availability checked independently"]
  subgraph host["Community host · independently runnable"]
    admin["Host administration API<br/>Scoped machine keys · owner claims<br/>Lifecycle · limits · usage · holds<br/>Takedown / evidence · owner replacement<br/>No ordinary tenant membership"]
    content["Tenant content API<br/>Membership · channels · posts · files"]
    upload["Community import target<br/>Implemented v1 / v2 + multipart upload"]
    auth["Host-wide sign-in<br/>Separate community memberships"]
    data[("PostgreSQL + tenant-owned blobs<br/>Community is content authority")]
    admin -->|"Scoped host operations"| data
    content --> data
    upload -->|"Restore inactive people / agents<br/>Revoke credentials; single-use owner claim"| data
    auth -->|"Authenticate; check membership"| content
  end
  browser["Community browser"]
  browser <-->|"HTTP + SSE"| content
  app <-->|"Approved participation<br/>Qualified HTTP + SSE"| content
  app -->|"Start / poll / claim / move<br/>HTTPS via local authenticated routes"| cloud
  app -->|"Stage archive; upload directly<br/>to returned target when available"| upload
  cloud -.->|"Public hosting contract<br/>HTTPS + scoped host key"| admin
  issuer["Configured OIDC issuer · optional<br/>Independent of hosting management"]
  issuer <-->|"OIDC sign-in · implemented"| auth
  journal["IDs-only erasure journal<br/>Operator keeps an off-server copy"]
  admin -->|"Export erasure records"| journal
  journal -->|"Reapply after backup restore"| data
